- content_for :title, "Thanks for joining the Amply waitlist"

.brand{ style: "text-align:center; margin:0 0 16px;" }
  %table{ role: "presentation", cellpadding: "0", cellspacing: "0", border: "0" }
    %tr
      %td{ style: "padding:0 8px 0 0; vertical-align:middle;" }
        = image_tag "cid:amply-logo",
                    alt: "Amply logo",
                    width: 24,
                    height: 24,
                    style: "display:block; border:0; outline:0; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px;"
      %td{ style: "vertical-align:middle; font-weight:700; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1;" }
        Amply



%h1
  THANKS FOR JOINING
  %br
  AMPLY WAITLIST.

%p
  Hi #{@user_request.name.presence || "there"},
  Soon, you’ll get early access to a tool built to bring order to your day — without the noise.
  Plan, track, and focus — all in one clean space.

%p You’ll be among the first to:
%ul
  %li Turn ideas into actions
  %li Capture thoughts instantly
  %li Stay organized for work, study, and life

%p We’ll keep you updated as we open early access.
%p — The Amply Team

%p.muted
  You received this email because you signed up for early access to Amply.
  By clicking “Submit” or continuing to use the service, you agree to our
  %a{ href: "https://amply.example.com/terms", style: "color:#0f172a;" } Terms of Service
  and
  %a{ href: "https://amply.example.com/privacy", style: "color:#0f172a;" } Privacy Policy.

%p.muted
  If you no longer wish to receive emails from Amply, you can unsubscribe here:
  %a{ href: "https://amply.example.com/unsubscribe?email=#{ERB::Util.url_encode(@user_request.email)}", style: "color:#0f172a;" } Unsubscribe
